<title>LITHUANIA: SUSPENSIONS ON VILNIUS BOURSE.</title>
<headline>SUSPENSIONS ON VILNIUS BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's stock exchange said on Tuesday that its board decided to suspend trade in the following shares:</p>
<p>- Pergale, from August 12 for one trading session, after its stocks were not quoted on the bourse for three months. After renewing the trade price fluctuation margins will not be applied.</p>
<p>- Kedainiu Cukrus, from August 14 to August 21, at issuer's request because of the general shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>- Hotel Lietuva, on August 18, due to the shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>- Marijampoles Grudai, on August 18, due to the shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>- Kauno Audiniai, on August 18, due to the shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
